{
  "id": "two-stage-report",
  "title": {
    "tr": "İki aşamalı rapor",
    "en": "A two-stage report"
  },
  "difficulty": 3,
  "language": "docker",
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "entry": "Dockerfile",
  "files": [
    {
      "name": "Dockerfile",
      "starter": "starter-Dockerfile.{lang}",
      "solution": "solution-Dockerfile"
    },
    {
      "name": "build_report.py",
      "readonly": true
    }
  ],
  "timeout_sec": 180,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "`FROM python:3.13-slim AS build` ... `FROM alpine:3.22` + `COPY --from=build /out /report`.",
      "en": "`FROM python:3.13-slim AS build` ... `FROM alpine:3.22` + `COPY --from=build /out /report`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n**Dockerfile**\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM python:3.13-slim AS build\nWORKDIR /src\nCOPY build_report.py .\nRUN python build_report.py\n\nFROM alpine:3.22\nCOPY --from=build /out /report\nCMD [\"cat\", \"/report/index.html\"]\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n**Dockerfile**\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM python:3.13-slim AS build\nWORKDIR /src\nCOPY build_report.py .\nRUN python build_report.py\n\nFROM alpine:3.22\nCOPY --from=build /out /report\nCMD [\"cat\", \"/report/index.html\"]\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "dockerfile",
      "rule": "stages",
      "min": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "dockerfile",
      "rule": "has",
      "instruction": "COPY",
      "value": "--from=build",
      "stage": "last",
      "show": "COPY --from=build /out /report"
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "expect": {
        "max_size_mb": 20,
        "logs_contains": [
          "<h1>Squares</h1>",
          "5 x 5 = 25"
        ],
        "file_missing": [
          "/usr/local/bin/python"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
